contract_change:
  api: pm test --run and pm test-all CLI rendering; new --full-output flag; MCP fullOutput parameter (tool parameter schema 4.26.0)
  before: "A passing linked-test row printed the command's complete stdout and stderr, ANSI escape sequences included"
  after: "A quiet passing run prints an escape-free tail of at most 6 lines and 480 characters per stream, adds stdout_omitted_bytes or stderr_omitted_bytes to shortened rows and names --full-output in omission_receipt; SDK and MCP results still carry the complete streams"
  migrate: Pass --full-output where a script parses a passing linked test's complete CLI stdout; SDK and MCP consumers need no change
